// MerkaiTrial.WebApi/appsettings.json
//
// CHANGES (062)
//
//   1. THE DUPLICATE "Email" BLOCK IS GONE. There were two, and the
//      first one — { "From": "quotes@madeevision.com" } — was dead.
//      EmailOptions has no "From" property; it has FromAddress. The two
//      blocks did not collide (different leaf keys, so the configuration
//      provider merged them rather than throwing), which is exactly why
//      nobody noticed: the setting simply did nothing, for ever, and the
//      file read as though the From address were configured twice with
//      two different values.
//
//   2. Email:AppBaseUrl WAS POINTING AT A PORT NOTHING SERVES.
//      It said https://localhost:61093. Your own log says Admin.Web is
//      https://localhost:5093 and the API is :61091 — 61093 is neither.
//      This is the address used to build the customer's /q/{token} link
//      when nothing passes one, so every such link was dead. The quote
//      page passes Request.Scheme + Host, which is the only reason your
//      test worked.
//
//   3. Serilog MinimumLevel gained an Override block. See the note on it.
//
// NOT IN THIS FILE, and must never be:
//      Email__ApiKey          Resend key          (user secrets / App Service)
//      Jwt__SigningKey                            (user secrets / App Service)
//      WhatsApp__AccessToken                      (user secrets / App Service)
// =====================================================================
